<!-- ============================== SIGNAL ============================== -->
<section class="section" id="signal" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="kicker">The signal</div>
      <h2>When venues disagree, read the divergence.</h2>
      <p>
        Spot and perp flow tell different stories. Spot accumulation against
        perp distribution often precedes a squeeze — and the reverse signals
        leverage-led risk. This is the read the composite alone can't give you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="divergence reveal">
      <div class="dv-head">
        <div class="dv-state">
          <span class="label">Current divergence state</span>
          <h3 id="dvState" class="neutral">Waiting for flow…</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="dv-tag" id="dvTag">initializing</span>
      </div>

      <div class="dv-bars">
        <div class="dv-bar">
          <span class="lbl"><i style="background:#4fe3c1"></i>Binance perp Δ</span>
          <div class="track">
            <div class="center"></div>
            <div class="fill pos" id="dvFillBinance" style="width:0%"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="val pos" id="dvValBinance">+0.000</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dv-bar">
          <span class="lbl"><i style="background:#6f8cff"></i>Coinbase spot Δ</span>
          <div class="track">
            <div class="center"></div>
            <div class="fill pos" id="dvFillCoinbase" style="width:0%"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="val pos" id="dvValCoinbase">+0.000</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dv-interp" id="dvInterp">
        Streaming live orderflow from Binance perps and Coinbase spot.
        Divergence reads will appear once both venues have printed.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================== CAPABILITIES ============================== -->
<section class="section" id="capabilities" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="kicker">Capabilities</div>
      <h2>Every print. Every level. Every venue.</h2>
      <p>Built for desks that trade off microstructure across venues, not lagging indicators.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="card card-lg reveal" style="--d:.04s">
        <div class="ico-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20V10M9 20V4M14 20v-7M19 20V7"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Aggressor-classified delta, per venue</h3>
        <p>
          Every Binance aggTrade and Coinbase match is classified by aggressor
          at ingest — buy-side or sell-side — then aggregated per venue, per
          second, per session. The composite is a weighted average across the
          venues that carry the signal.
        </p>
        <div class="metric">
          <span class="num" data-count="18.4" data-suffix="%">0</span>
          <span class="unit">average fill improvement</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-lg reveal" style="--d:.1s">
        <div class="ico-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="15" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Live DOM ladders, side by side</h3>
        <p>
          Binance's top-20 book and Coinbase's level2_batch stream feed two
          independent ladders in real time. Compare resting size at the touch
          across venues — the first sign of a liquidity pull shows up there.
        </p>
        <div class="metric">
          <span class="num" data-count="1240">0</span>
          <span class="unit">price levels tracked</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-md reveal" style="--d:.14s">
        <div class="ico-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2 3 7v6c0 5 4 8 9 9 5-1 9-4 9-9V7z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Honest about CME</h3>
        <p>Real-time CME requires a licensed feed. We label delayed data clearly and exclude it from the composite until you connect one.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-md reveal" style="--d:.18s">
        <div class="ico-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 18 9 8l4 6 3-4 4 8"/><path d="M3 21h18"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Weighted, configurable composite</h3>
        <p>Venue weights reflect price-discovery contribution. Tune them per desk, per timeframe, per strategy — persisted locally.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-md reveal" style="--d:.22s">
        <div class="ico-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg></div>
